        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stats don't lie.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist has given up being an adventurer and become a detective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An incident occurs at a bar he happens to stop by!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Detectives in this world can peek into the stats of others.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use these words to solve the case!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Overview</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a first-person mystery adventure in which you investigate cases while monitoring the stat screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use stats and deduction to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>main story</strong>, you unravel the mystery of a strange incident that took place in &quot;Omland,&quot; a parallel world ruled by stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing the main story unlocks the following substories.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extra</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sequel to the main story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Another Episode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on a new incident that takes place in the real world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Play Mode</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Easy</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of choices is reduced.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Normal</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Hard</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can take on the &quot;Challenge to the Reader.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mode requires a broad perspective and deep reasoning.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Play Time</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard Mode will take longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Multiplayer Mode</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite online friends to join the game and enjoy the story together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The host handles all basic operations, but all players can individually view logs and investigation materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to uncover the truth.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stats don't lie.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist has given up being an adventurer and become a detective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An incident occurs at a bar he happens to stop by!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Detectives in this world can peek into the stats of others.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use these words to solve the case!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Overview</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a first-person mystery adventure in which you investigate cases while monitoring the stat screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use stats and deduction to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>main story</strong>, you unravel the mystery of a strange incident that took place in &quot;Omland,&quot; a parallel world ruled by stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing the main story unlocks the following substories.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extra</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sequel to the main story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Another Episode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on a new incident that takes place in the real world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Play Mode</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Easy</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of choices is reduced.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Normal</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Hard</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can take on the &quot;Challenge to the Reader.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mode requires a broad perspective and deep reasoning.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Play Time</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard Mode will take longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Multiplayer Mode</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite online friends to join the game and enjoy the story together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The host handles all basic operations, but all players can individually view logs and investigation materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to uncover the truth.</p>",
